    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109685" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὔρχη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>jar,</i> for pickles, in acc.
			pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὔρχας,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				676
			</span></i> (anap.); nom. sg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὔρχη</span>
			(twice corr. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὔρχης</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ταρίχου, ὑπογαστρίων ὔρχη,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.428.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				84
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; for wine, in acc. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὔρχας,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				423
			</span></i>. (
				Aeol.
			acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.14
			</span></i>, Sch.D.T.<i><span class="en">
				p.143H.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψιλοῦται</span> Sch.D.T.l.c.;
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑρχή</span></b>  (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">:ἐφ᾽ ἧς τὰ φορτία φέρουσιν οἱ ναῦται,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>) is perh. a difft. word.)</div>
